      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah not having a mic icon with the HUD off has caused me to stare at people. Menacingly.... Because I'm muted. I'm mentally juggling whether that last time I hit \"V\" was the mute or unmute state.\n\nTo be fair, I do stare at people, so this isn't abnormal behavior. Which means nobody says \"hey, are you muted?\". Nope, they just assume the green alien cat has some alien cat reasons for this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-09-10T09:42:21.404Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I like the new HUD, but the mic icon being moved up there is throwing me off. I don't mind it being part of this new hud system, but the position should be in the bottom left I think.\n\nsimilar to \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/keep-the-old-mic-icon\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/keep-old-mute-hud-icon",
